      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a paraliturgical prayer for rain during the wet season, read during the festival of Sukkot, following in the tradition of Yiddish tkhines, albeit written in French. The prayer was included by Rabbi Arnaud Aron and Jonas Ennery in their opus, אמרי לב <tei:hi rend="italic">Prières d’un Coeur Israelite</tei:hi> (first edition) published in 1848 by the Société Consistoriale de Bons Livres.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_21923_notes"/>
